  "description": "The engine behind the Abiotic Factor save editor: byte-exact GVAS save reading/writing, the player/world/metadata save models, game-data catalogs (items, recipes, skills, quest flags), and the plugin host. The desktop app and CLI are thin front-ends over this library. Bundles the Apache-2.0 UeSaveGame.Json and CUE4Parse assemblies it builds against.",
